    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WANDERSTATE</strong>\u00a0is a first-person indie psychological horror experience inspired by the <i>Backrooms</i> and <i>liminal</i> <i>space</i> aesthetics.<br>There are no monsters chasing you. No jumpscares screaming in your face. This is a horror game rooted in <strong>unease</strong>, <strong>loneliness</strong>, <strong>isolation</strong> and the <strong>fear of the unknown</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Environments</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unsettling, surreal spaces where logic breaks down. Hallways loop back on themselves. Rooms shift when you're not looking. Walls breathe, floors whisper.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/1d8cd83a361494115e0cf0fddb947924.poster.avif?t=1752216779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/1d8cd83a361494115e0cf0fddb947924.webm?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/1d8cd83a361494115e0cf0fddb947924.mp4?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Entities, Just Atmosphere</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no creatures lurking in the dark. Instead, you\u2019re left alone with your thoughts and a world that doesn\u2019t quite make sense. It\u2019s the creeping fear that something might happen, even though nothing ever does\u2026 or maybe already did. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you face isn\u2019t a monster, but your own unease\u2014the fear of not knowing what\u2019s real anymore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror here is ambient, the slow unraveling of comfort and logic. You\u2019ll start to question your surroundings, your choices, even your memory. <br><i>Was that wall always there?</i><br><i>Have you been here before?</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/bf7c696883bcc7fa14b8be61537f9f25.poster.avif?t=1752216779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/bf7c696883bcc7fa14b8be61537f9f25.webm?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/bf7c696883bcc7fa14b8be61537f9f25.mp4?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive, Minimal Interface</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No HUD. No guidance. The entire experience is designed to pull you in and never let go, letting you explore at your own pace and interpret the space in your own way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/4911bf55713efaf0e536e9d98ec0de0e.poster.avif?t=1752216779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/4911bf55713efaf0e536e9d98ec0de0e.webm?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/4911bf55713efaf0e536e9d98ec0de0e.mp4?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPER</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I created <strong>WANDERSTATE</strong>\u00a0to explore a quieter kind of horror: the kind that doesn\u2019t scream, but whispers. The kind that doesn\u2019t jump out at you, but waits. This game is for those who love atmosphere, tension, and the feeling that something is deeply wrong, even if you can\u2019t explain what it is.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/295543a98a332b5bdbf74829a39a45c7.poster.avif?t=1752216779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/295543a98a332b5bdbf74829a39a45c7.webm?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/295543a98a332b5bdbf74829a39a45c7.mp4?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains audio/visual effects that may be disturbing to some players, including spatial distortion, liminal imagery, and psychological unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no gore, violence, or jumpscares, but the atmosphere is intentionally unsettling.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WANDERSTATE</strong>\u00a0is a first-person indie psychological horror experience inspired by the <i>Backrooms</i> and <i>liminal</i> <i>space</i> aesthetics.<br>There are no monsters chasing you. No jumpscares screaming in your face. This is a horror game rooted in <strong>unease</strong>, <strong>loneliness</strong>, <strong>isolation</strong> and the <strong>fear of the unknown</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Environments</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unsettling, surreal spaces where logic breaks down. Hallways loop back on themselves. Rooms shift when you're not looking. Walls breathe, floors whisper.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/1d8cd83a361494115e0cf0fddb947924.poster.avif?t=1752216779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/1d8cd83a361494115e0cf0fddb947924.webm?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/1d8cd83a361494115e0cf0fddb947924.mp4?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Entities, Just Atmosphere</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no creatures lurking in the dark. Instead, you\u2019re left alone with your thoughts and a world that doesn\u2019t quite make sense. It\u2019s the creeping fear that something might happen, even though nothing ever does\u2026 or maybe already did. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you face isn\u2019t a monster, but your own unease\u2014the fear of not knowing what\u2019s real anymore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror here is ambient, the slow unraveling of comfort and logic. You\u2019ll start to question your surroundings, your choices, even your memory. <br><i>Was that wall always there?</i><br><i>Have you been here before?</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/bf7c696883bcc7fa14b8be61537f9f25.poster.avif?t=1752216779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/bf7c696883bcc7fa14b8be61537f9f25.webm?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/bf7c696883bcc7fa14b8be61537f9f25.mp4?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive, Minimal Interface</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No HUD. No guidance. The entire experience is designed to pull you in and never let go, letting you explore at your own pace and interpret the space in your own way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/4911bf55713efaf0e536e9d98ec0de0e.poster.avif?t=1752216779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/4911bf55713efaf0e536e9d98ec0de0e.webm?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/4911bf55713efaf0e536e9d98ec0de0e.mp4?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPER</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I created <strong>WANDERSTATE</strong>\u00a0to explore a quieter kind of horror: the kind that doesn\u2019t scream, but whispers. The kind that doesn\u2019t jump out at you, but waits. This game is for those who love atmosphere, tension, and the feeling that something is deeply wrong, even if you can\u2019t explain what it is.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/295543a98a332b5bdbf74829a39a45c7.poster.avif?t=1752216779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/295543a98a332b5bdbf74829a39a45c7.webm?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651230/extras/295543a98a332b5bdbf74829a39a45c7.mp4?t=1752216779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTENT WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains audio/visual effects that may be disturbing to some players, including spatial distortion, liminal imagery, and psychological unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no gore, violence, or jumpscares, but the atmosphere is intentionally unsettling.</p>",
    "short_description": "You find yourself alone in a place that feels familiar\u2026 but not quite right. Wander aimlessly or with purpose, it won\u2019t matter. Is there an end? Has anyone been here before you? Time feels slow. Or maybe it's frozen. Or maybe\u2026 you\u2019re not meant to leave.",
